    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>与小E重新聊聊电影《爱乐之城》（La La Land 2016）。录制于2026年4月20日。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目瞬间：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=00:28"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a></span></span><span> 我们依旧会想聊「拉拉蓝」</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=05:43"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a></span></span><span> 剧情梳理开始</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=08:41"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a></span></span><span> 剧情梳理结束（难得）</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=09:41"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a></span></span><span> 片中的浪漫细节总能打动你我</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=21:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a></span></span><span> 自我实现与选择爱情（小E按：二者一定冲突吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=26:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a></span></span><span> 这个故事里可以不存在「第一主角」</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=33:23"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a></span></span><span> 结尾的蒙太奇，究竟是谁的想象</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=47:19"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2839">47:19</a></span></span><span> 小塞身上的珍贵品质</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:05:16"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3916">01:05:16</a></span></span><span> 米娅和小塞是在哪一刻喜欢上彼此的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:12:53"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4373">01:12:53</a></span></span><span> 多年过去，看电影的我们被打动的地方是否发生了变化</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:21:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4890">01:21:30</a></span></span><span> 在当今语境下，什么样的男性角色是经得住考验的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:31:13"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5473">01:31:13</a></span></span><span> 「我的一部分轨迹已经永久地和你编织在了一起」</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:36:19"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5779">01:36:19</a></span><