    <title>159. 潮起潮落《一战再战》是什么都不为</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69720d21ef1cf272a7dffabe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69720d21ef1cf272a7dffabe</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Jan 2026 12:02:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>与小到聊聊电影《一战再战》（One Battle After Another 2025）。录制于2026年1月13日。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目瞬间：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=00:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a></span></span><span> 滞后这么久才聊，不合时宜</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=03:17"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a></span></span><span> 剧透预警</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=11:43"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a></span></span><span> 剧情讲解结束</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=12:47"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a></span></span><span> 两遍看的感觉大不相同</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=16:25"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a></span></span><span> 到底是不是写实的笔触？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=19:34"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a></span></span><span> 先把「森赛」说完</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=22:53"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a></span></span><span> 我若说角色都很扁平，阁下作何应对？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=25:46"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a></span></span><span> 冒着让人觉得生硬的风险，提醒你仔细去理解她</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=30:27"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a></span></span><span> 只把妈妈理解为需要唾骂的人物就有些可惜了</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=31:41"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a></span></span><span> 光谱更加抽象：追求极端自由与追求极端秩序之争？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=37:06"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">37:06</a></span></span><span> 也许「森塞」在年轻的时候就是「切格瓦拉」</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=45:24"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2724">45:24</a></span></span><span> 这「洛克乔」却是一个善终</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=47:37"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2857">47:37</a></span></span><span> 好兄弟有钱一起赚俱乐部</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=55:59"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3359">55:59</a></span></span><span> 这里边儿没什么人是守法的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=60:55"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3655">60:55</a></span></span><span> 用姜文式符号隐喻法理解这个电影</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=64:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a></span></span><span> 视听的精彩是需要审美的么？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=66:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4000">66:40</a></span></span><span> 你简直不给我一片小屎</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=67:02"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">67:02</a></span></span><span> 怎么理解跨性别告密者？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=71:24"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4284">71:24</a></span></span><span> 在温柔中放下「沾沾自喜」的某一部分且不失批判</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小到：在德留学生。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>马里：游戏制作人，播客制作人。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>注明出处：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span></span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36176155/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36176155/"><span>电影《一战再战》</span></a></li><span></span><li><span>音乐：电影原声 Guitar for Willa - Jonny Greenwood</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>关于宽马路：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>是一个播客。在这个播客里，我们认真聊聊喜欢的作品，顺便怀疑人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您想持续收听，烦请搜索并关注「宽马路」于任意播客客户端，认准黑底白字版本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外，宽马路还有个里世界，叫路马宽。</span></p>]]></description>
